      "v4_failed_credentials": "The login details from the Tuya cloud cannot be used for this device.",
      "v4_failed_connect": "Home Assistant could not connect to the device over Bluetooth. Move it closer to Home Assistant or a Bluetooth proxy, close the Smart Life app and try again.",
